// Boss tricks.
// Blob tricks throw something at the boss at 70% and 35% health (GRIME.at).
// Until you tap all of it away, your taps do half damage.
// Timed tricks come back every few seconds: `every` is the wait, `last` how long it lasts.
//   hp: tricks that cost you a lot of damage come with a little less health,
//       so every boss takes about as long to beat as the health tables say
//   tip: shown under the boss bar · pip: what Pip warns you about at the start
